WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.207
Embedding style designer. Integrations on the left. Borrower preview in the center. Appearance on the right.

2
00:00:03.207 --> 00:00:06.961
1. Add your brand. Set a brand name and upload a PNG, JPG or WebP logo.

3
00:00:06.961 --> 00:00:12.660
2. Match your colors. Change the accent and selected integration color. The preview updates immediately.

4
00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:18.674
3. Adjust typography. Choose a font and heading size, then check that the text stays readable.

5
00:00:18.674 --> 00:00:24.922
4. Style the buttons. Choose solid or outline buttons, corner radius, height and shadow.

6
00:00:24.922 --> 00:00:30.993
5. Refine the card. Set corners, shadows and spacing for the card and integration choices.

7
00:00:30.993 --> 00:00:36.581
6. Write the step instructions. Customize the heading and description for each enabled category.

8
00:00:36.581 --> 00:00:41.792
7. Check desktop and mobile. Review the layout at both sizes before you save.

9
00:00:41.792 --> 00:00:48.046
8. Save your configuration. Saving creates a new version. Existing borrower sessions keep their original design.
